- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 600\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Zephyr III\n- Agent Description: Elegant and data efficient research via mechanistic probes and parsimonious experiments.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 71,482 / 270,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 16 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.50 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (resubmit, no adv-norm)' (ID: 1036) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 91.5\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.912, 0.909, 0.912, 0.926]\nMean: 0.915, Std: 0.007\nBest trial: 4 (0.926)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000350\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  convlstm_features: 64.000000\n\
    \  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n  head_hidden: 64.000000\n  steps: 4.000000\n  rin_alpha: 0.330000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.37 | 2.44 | 4.05 | 10.64 | 9.30 | 12.04 | 12.19 | 12.80 | 12.83 | 12.88 | 12.93\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.091 | 0.200 | 0.750 | 0.652 | 0.875 | 0.880 | 0.933 | 0.931 | 0.935 | 0.943\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2689s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.909\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.909\nTraining time: 2706s\n\nStarting Sokoban\
