    \ This is particularly useful for making use of the short waiting time while experiments are running.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `storage write zephyr/submissions/a2c_td0_advnorm_masked_vlc055.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.60 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (resubmit, no adv-norm)' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 1039.\n- File created successfully: zephyr/submissions/a2c_td0_advnorm_masked_vlc055.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1039 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.60 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct\
    \ RNN (resubmit, no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 599 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1039 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.60 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (resubmit, no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 599 | running |\n| 1036 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.50 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (resubmit, no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 598 | 91.50 |\n| 1033 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.60 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 597 | n.a. |\n| 1032 | 1 | A2C TD(0) — vlc=0.50 — α=0.33, head=64 — scan-correct RNN (no adv-norm) | Zephyr III | 597 | n.a. |\n| 1028 | 1 | A2C TD(0) + advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM), vlc=0.50 | Zephyr III | 595 | 33.70 |\n| 1027 | 1 | A2C TD(0) baseline confirm — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 595 | 92.60 |\n| 1025 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.30 with advantage normalization —\
    \ α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 82.40 |\n| 1024 | 1 | A2C GAE λ=0.20 with advantage normalization — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN (RIN LN‑ConvLSTM) | Zephyr III | 593 | 70.40 |\n| 1009 | 1 | A2C (GAE λ sweep {0.0,0.2,0.4}) — α=0.33, head=64 — scan‑correct RNN rollout | Zephyr II | 581 | 0.00 |\n| 1006 | 1 | A2C (TD(0) via GAE λ=0) — α sweep {0.20,0.33}, head=48 — RIN LN‑ConvLSTM | Zephyr II | 580 | 0.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 45 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-45, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example,\
